{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As demons devour the ruins of civilization, you'll challenge endless cycles of death in a pixel-style roguelike gameplay across randomly generated apocalyptic battlefields. Every map, enemy layout, and resource point refreshes randomly, from shattered cities to radioactive wastelands, where beast lords and mutated creatures strike at any moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras/95695142f2e26e133491e0040f3d12ad.avif?t=1752898066\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras_big/95695142f2e26e133491e0040f3d12ad.avif?t=1752898066 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the permanent death mechanism, choose survivor characters with distinct traits, combine randomly dropped post-apocalyptic gear and skill trees, and fight your way through bullet storms. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras/9216e4a5525657a913bad90359335c3e.avif?t=1752898066\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras_big/9216e4a5525657a913bad90359335c3e.avif?t=1752898066 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the pixel-art wasteland, every rebirth is the ultimate test of strategy and courage\u2014can you piece together the final code for civilization's survival in a world ruled by beasts?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras/ffa6024f25d9866565f79fad3759539a.avif?t=1752898066\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras_big/ffa6024f25d9866565f79fad3759539a.avif?t=1752898066 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770010?t=1752898066","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770010?t=1752898066","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/63a3629b7785d7bfe2dbb34dcf571b2600ac81f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752898066","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/63a3629b7785d7bfe2dbb34dcf571b2600ac81f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752898066","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As demons devour the ruins of civilization, you'll challenge endless cycles of death in a pixel-style roguelike gameplay across randomly generated apocalyptic battlefields. Every map, enemy layout, and resource point refreshes randomly, from shattered cities to radioactive wastelands, where beast lords and mutated creatures strike at any moment. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras/95695142f2e26e133491e0040f3d12ad.avif?t=1752898066\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770010/extras_big/95695142f2e26e133491e0040f3d12ad.avif?t=1752898066 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph